  m_text: "\uADF8\uB798\uD53D\n\n<b># \uC54C\uD30C \uD14D\uC2A4\uCC98</b>\nKenney
    Particle Pack(CC0)\n\n---\n\n\uC0AC\uC6B4\uB4DC\n\n<b># SFMusicPack_SND</b>\n-
    \uD06C\uB808\uB527 \uD544\uC694\n[Copyright](C) 2014 DEGICA, LLC\nMusician: Joel
    Steudler\n```\nField_-_Ecumenopolis: \uC801\uB2F9\uD788 \uBC15\uC790\uAC10 -
    \uB85C\uBE44\n\nBattle_-_Disruptor_Ray: \uBE60\uB974\uAC8C \uC2E0\uB0A8\nField_-_Exploring_The_Rim:
    \uC2DC\uB124\uB9C8\uD2F1 \uC5B4\uB450\uC6C0, \uC801\uB2F9\uD788 \uBC15\uC790\uAC10\nField_-_Nexus_Six:
    \uAE34\uC7A5\uAC10, \uC801\uB2F9\uD788 \uBC15\uC790\uAC10\nMenu_-_Binary_Suns:
    \uB9E4\uC6B0 \uC870\uC6A9\uD568, \uC794\uC794\uD55C \uBC15\uC790\uAC10\nMenu_-_Mission_Briefing:
    \uC870\uC6A9\uD568, \uBD84\uC704\uAE30\nMenu_-_Serious_Decisions: \uC5B4\uB450\uC6C0,
    \uBD84\uC704\uAE30\n```\n\n<b># SFSoundEffects_SND</b>\n- \uD06C\uB808\uB527
    \uD544\uC694\n[Copyright](C) 2014 DEGICA, LLC\nMusician: Joel Steudler\n```\nbeep_neutral_04:
    UI\uBC84\uD2BC \uC785\uB825\uC74C\nblaster_01: Bore \uBC1C\uC0AC\uC74C\nglitch_01:
    Overheat\nalarm_siren_loop_04: Loop_Overheat\nmanhole_metal_door_lid_impact_03:
    Crash\n```\n\n<b># Gamemaster Audio - Pro Sound Collection</b>\n\n```\nfoley_soldier_gear_equipment_rattle_movement_light_01:
    \uC544\uC774\uD15C \uD53D\uC5C5\n```\n\n<b># RPG Maker</b>\n```\nExplosion7:
    Brakkar \uBC1C\uC0AC\uC74C\nExplosion1: Explosion\n```\n\n<b># Pixarbay</b>\n\n<b>##
    DavidDumaisAudio</b>\n```\nVraxxShot: Vraxx \uBC1C\uC0AC\uC74C\n- https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/film-special-effects-sci-fi-weapon-laser-shot-04-316416/\n```\n\n<b>##
    AudioPapkin</b>\n```\nVeylanceLoop: Veylance \uB808\uC774\uC800\n- https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/film-special-effects-science-fiction-effect-019-305479/\n```\n\n<b>##
    DennisH18</b>\n```\nPyronLaunch, PyronLoop: Pyron \uBC1C\uC0AC\uC74C, \uB8E8\uD504\uC74C\n-
    https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/film-special-effects-flame-thrower-128555/\n```\n\n<b>##
